    ],
    "tips": [
      {
        "id": "there-has-been",
        "title": "There’s been an accident",
        "body": [
          "**Kumetokea ajali** ni **There has been (There’s been) an accident.** **Kuna moto** ni **There’s a fire!**",
          "Kwa yaliyompata mtu: **He’s hurt** (ameumia), **She’s been robbed** (ameibiwa). Kuomba msaada: **Help!** **Call the police!** **Call an ambulance!**"
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "dont-be",
        "title": "Don’t…!",
        "body": [
          "**Usi-…-e** ni **Don’t** + kitenzi: **Don’t run!** (usikimbie), **Don’t be afraid!** (usiogope). Ni ile ile kwa mtu mmoja au wengi.",
          "**Tulia** ni **Calm down** au **Stay calm**. **You’re safe** ni uko salama."
        ]
      }
    ],
    "culture": [
      {
        "title": "Namba za dharura",
        "body": [
          "Namba ya dharura ni tofauti kila nchi: **999** Kenya na Uingereza, **112** Tanzania na Ulaya, **911** Marekani. Hifadhi namba za mahali ulipo."
        ]
      }
    ]
  },
